{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 126, "line_no": 22, "text": "如马黑寨“乡规碑”云：", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1525, "w": 394, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "如马黑寨“乡规碑”云：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1525, "w": 394, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 126, "line_no": 23, "text": "士农工商，是君王之正民，奸诈淫恶，乃乡里之匪类。我等生居乡末弹丸，", "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 1597, "w": 1303, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "士农工商，是君王之正民，奸诈淫恶，乃乡里之匪类。我等生居乡末弹丸，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 1597, "w": 1303, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 126, "line_no": 24, "text": "少睹王化之典。各宣所有，务要出入相友，守望相助，勿以相仇之心。男当以", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1662, "w": 1379, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "少睹王化之典。各宣所有，务要出入相友，守望相助，勿以相仇之心。男当以", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1662, "w": 1379, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 126, "line_no": 25, "text": "耕，女绩纺，庶乎家家盈宁，殷室安居，乐享光天化日。所有奸情盗贼皆起于赌", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1726, "w": 1379, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "耕，女绩纺，庶乎家家盈宁，殷室安居，乐享光天化日。所有奸情盗贼皆起于赌", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1726, "w": 1379, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 126, "line_no": 26, "text": "博。严示子弟，贫不可为贼，贱只能卖气力，莫勿行乱偷。①", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1790, "w": 1013, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "博。严示子弟，贫不可为贼，贱只能卖气力，莫勿行乱偷。①", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1790, "w": 1013, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 126, "line_no": 27, "text": "者冲地方的“乡规碑”说：", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1855, "w": 438, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "者冲地方的“乡规碑”说：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1855, "w": 438, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 126, "line_no": 28, "text": "君臣、父子、夫妇、朋友、昆弟，各守五伦，各尽人道。君尽道、臣尽忠、子尽", "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 1923, "w": 1299, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "君臣、父子、夫妇、朋友、昆弟，各守五伦，各尽人道。君尽道、臣尽忠、子尽", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 1923, "w": 1299, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
